WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.760
When you open an unfamiliar project, a
function name only gets you part of the way.

2
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.655
The agent starts at the command line file and
asks where the greet function comes from.

3
00:00:12.655 --> 00:00:16.520
Code search follows that import
and returns the source location.

4
00:00:25.700 --> 00:00:29.890
Ask from the file you’re reading when
several places use the same name.

5
00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:32.900
That anchors the lookup to
the call you care about.
